Xsynth - Copyright (C) 1999 S. J. Brookes

Version 1.0.1 - 6 July 1999

Some minor changes to the code have made the synth much more resilient to
external interruptions.  The occasional problem with corrupted MIDI input
also seems to have disappeared...

The clicks that were present sometimes at the start and end of notes have
been removed by writing silence to the dsp device between the notes.

Thanks to Dave Phillips (dlphilp@bright.net) for helping with the testing
required to turn version 1.0.0 into version 1.0.1.


Version 1.0.2 - 19 July 1999

No functional changes, but the code has been cleaned up slightly...

Thanks to Stefan Nitschke (nitschke@fzi.de) for bringing to my attention
a couple of major bugs.
